energy (Lgravo) — the release of thermal plus gravitational potential ener gy — and photon
emission (surface luminosity, Lsur) for a typical white dwarf is shown in Fig. 10. The evolu-
tion from the planetary nebulae stage to the domain of the very cool white dwarfs is shown.
