Finally, there is a single f -mode for a given ℓ (≥ 2) value. Usually, this mode does
not have any node in the radial direction ( k = 0) and possesses an intermediate character
between g- and p-modes. In fact, its eigenfrequency lies between that of the low order g-
and p-modes, and generally slowly increases when ℓ increases.
